Service Focus Team Chair/President, provided additional information.
Chairman White and
committee members Aldrich and Roybal commented on the item.
g)
Professional Services Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and GSG
Architecmre. Inc for the Municipal Building Spatial Analysis Project.
(2021
Specific Purpose Option Tax Fund)
Dr. Aldrich moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $115,027.00, seconded by Mr. Esquibel.
Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Adele Bartel, Public Works Staff Engineer, provided a staffreport and Craig LaVoy, Public Works
Deputy Director, provided additional information. Chairman White and committee members
Aldrich and Roybal commented on the item.
h)
Purchase and Sale Agreement for property located at 813 West 23”’ Street for the
Reed Avenue Corridor Project. (2021 Specific Purpose Option Tax Fund)
Dr. Aldrich moved to approve in an amount not to exceed $161,000.00, seconded by Mr. Roybal.
