29.
CONSIDERATION OF BIDS/PURCHASES/REQUESTS FOR PROPOSALS:
a)
Consideration to Purchase between the City of Cheyenne and Dowdle Studios for
the Commissioned Painting and Puzzles Project. (General Fund Reserves)
The item died due to the lack of a motion.
Lonnie Olson, Planning & Development Department. provided a staff report.
Charles Bloom,
Planning & Development Department Director, and Kirk Nord, Dowdie Studios, provided
additional information. Chairman White and committee member Aldrich commented on the item.
Public comment was made by Pete Laybourn, Councilman Ward I. and Wendy Volk.
There being no further items for the agenda to come before the Finance Committee, the meeting
was adjourned at 12:54 p.m.
